# AIF Security And Privacy

Security review is required for auth, secrets, shell commands, dependencies, MCP, browser automation, and external tools.

Privacy review is required for user data, storage, sync, notifications, external job sources, plugins, MCP, and AI integrations.

Do not create real secrets. Do not assume telemetry, sync, or external AI processing is acceptable by default.
